   ],
   "title": "Renewable Energy",
   "lead": "<p>ZOLLER relies 100 percent on renewable energy to meet its electricity needs. The company uses hydroelectric and solar power exclusively to make a sustainable contribution to environmental protection and improve its CO2e footprint. Through this eco-friendly power supply, ZOLLER underscores its commitment to a sustainable future and responsible business practices.</p> <p>The large rooftop photovoltaic system at ZOLLER’s headquarters in Pleidelsheim produces a portion of the green electricity we need on the shop-floor. Our energy strategy supports our goal of reducing ZOLLER’s CO2e emissions by 40 percent by 2030.</p>",
   "images": [],
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "textmedia",
     "header": "",
     "body": "<p>When the sun shines, electricity flows—the large rooftop solar array at our Pleidelsheim site is part of our sustainability strategy. </p>",
